</section>
${ACTIONBLOCK}
${CVSSBLOCK}
${CATBLOCKS}
<footer><span>AIXray · by PowerTrue Systems · read-only · this snapshot is yours to keep</span><a href="mailto:review@powertruesystems.com">${REVIEW_CTA}</a></footer>
